DexTacWAM builds on Genie-Envisioner-V1:

    https://github.com/AgibotTech/Genie-Envisioner-V1
    pinned commit d54425c4d0ba9d56b33adc4bfe5e5187e5335603

That project does not carry a licence, so none of its code is redistributed
here. This repository contains only work authored by the DexTacWAM authors:

  * src/        new modules that sit alongside the upstream tree
  * configs/    training and evaluation configurations
  * tests/      unit and smoke tests
  * patches/    a diff against the pinned upstream commit

`setup_upstream.sh` clones Genie-Envisioner-V1 yourself, applies the patch and
overlays src/. Whether you may use the result is governed by whatever terms
AgibotTech grants for their code; the MIT licence in this repository covers the
DexTacWAM contribution only.

The pretrained LTX-Video and Genie-Envisioner weights that the configs expect
are distributed by their respective authors under their own terms.
